<title>INDIA: India RBI to auction 1.5 bln rupees 91-day t-bills.</title>
<headline>India RBI to auction 1.5 bln rupees 91-day t-bills.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Tuesday it will hold an auction of 91-day treasury bills for 1.5 billion rupees on May 9.</p>
<p>Bids will be accepted on Friday and results announced the same day, the RBI said in a</p>
<p>Results will be announced the next day, it said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
